  Source of truth: native-app features/whatsnew + res/values-ar/strings.xml.

  np_p3_whats_new_title maps to native whats_new_title ("الجديد"). The loading / empty /
  error strings are English literals in native WhatsNewRoute.kt (no Arabic native value);
